  "prefLabel": "Agr 1203.11 Manufacturer or Distributor; Name and Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1203.11 Manufacturer or Distributor; Name and Address.\n\n(a) The name and principal mailing address of the manufacturer or distributor shall appear. The principal mailing address shall include the street address, city, state, and zip code.\n\n(b) When a person manufactures or distributes a pet food or specialty pet food in a place other than the principal place of business, the label may state the principal place of business in lieu of the actual place where each package was manufactured, or packaged, or from where each package is to be distributed.\n\nSource. #12788, eff 5-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr1200.html"
